 "section_summary": "This section contains U.S. Embassy despatches from Chungking enclosing translations of intercepted Japanese commercial messages. The messages concern wartime trade, shipping shortages, permits, prices, industrial projects, rice, rubber, textiles, and other goods moving among Japan, French Indochina, China, and Southeast Asia. The section begins within an earlier enclosure and ends within the enclosure to despatch no. 2306.",
